# Night Market: "This land enters tapped. As it enters, choose a color" (CR 614.1c) and "{T}: Add one mana of the chosen
# color" (CR 605.1a, 607.2d). Bot1 plays it on turn 1 and chooses blue: it enters tapped and cannot be tapped (refused). On
